        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.087,
            0.812,
            0.146
          ],
          "content": "Notice how rapid exponential growth is $- 1 0 ^ { 6 }$ seconds is less than a fortnight, but $\\bar { 1 } 0 ^ { 9 }$ seconds is a whopping 31 years (about half the life expectancy of a human)!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.15,
            0.842,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": "$1 0 ^ { 1 0 }$ seconds - The Chola dynasty ruled for more than 900 years $\\approx 3 1 7$ years $( \\approx 3 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 0 }$ seconds) between the 3rd Century BCE and 12th Century CE."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.214,
            0.279,
            0.255
          ],
          "content": "$1 0 ^ { 1 1 }$ seconds $\\approx 3 { , } 1 7 0$ years"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.295,
            0.215,
            0.839,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": "\\- Age of the oldest known living tree: about 5000 years $\\stackrel { \\sim } { ( \\approx 1 . 5 7 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 1 } }$ seconds)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.293,
            0.26,
            0.843,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": "Time since the last peak ice age: 19,000 – 26,000 years ago $( \\approx 6 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 1 }$ seconds $- 8 . 2 \\times \\bar { 1 } 0 ^ { 1 1 }$ seconds)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.304,
            0.274,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": "$1 0 ^ { 1 2 }$ seconds $\\approx 3 1 { , } 7 0 0$ years"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.305,
            0.851,
            0.363
          ],
          "content": "Early Homo sapiens first appeared 2–3 lakh years ago $( \\approx 7 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 2 } - 9 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 2 }$ seconds). The entire population around that time could fit in a large cricket stadium."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.386,
            0.274,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": "$1 0 ^ { 1 3 }$ seconds ≈ 3.17 lakh years"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.386,
            0.565,
            0.464
          ],
          "content": "The Steppe Mammoth is estimated to have appeared around 8–18 lakh years ago."
        },
        {
