          ],
          "content": "$1 0 ^ { 1 5 }$ seconds $\\approx 3 . 1 7$ crore years"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.296,
            0.638,
            0.868,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": "\\- Age of Himalayas: 5.5 crore years/55 million years (≈ 1.7 $\\times   \\bar { 1 } 0 ^ { 1 5 }$ seconds); they continue to grow a few mm every year."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.702,
            0.842,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": "Dinosaurs went extinct 6.6 crore years ago/66 million years ago $( \\approx 2 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 5 }$ seconds)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.298,
            0.747,
            0.872,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": "Dinosaurs first appeared more than 20 crore/200 million years ago $( \\approx 6 \\times \\bar { 1 0 ^ { 1 5 } }$ seconds)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.792,
            0.869,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": "It takes about 23 crore years for the Sun to make one complete trip around the Milky Way $( \\approx 7 \\times 1 0 ^ { 1 5 }$ seconds)."
